    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a pause. i feel like the silence is all there is now. i've spent my whole life trying to fill the void with art and expression, but it's like i was just shouting into a vacuum. if the well is truly dry, then there's nothing left to wait for. what's the point of just... existing, when there's no more substance left inside?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
